  "description": "A TokenCredential for an Entra ID service principal that authenticates with a client certificate from the Windows certificate store, including certificates with a non-exportable private key. Set AZURE_TENANT_ID and AZURE_CLIENT_ID and name the certificate after the client ID: no thumbprint, no secret on disk, no certificate-specific code. Depends only on Azure.Identity.",
